<title>USA: USA Detergents says names Coslow CFO.</title>
<headline>USA Detergents says names Coslow CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USA Detergents Inc said on Monday that it has named Richard Coslow as its new chief financial officer, effective April 14, 1997.</p>
<p>Coslow succeeds Hal Macsata, who has become vice president and treasurer of the company, USA Detergents said.</p>
<p>Since 1984, Coslow has been a vice president and controller for Toshiba America Consumer Products Inc, a unit of Toshiba Corp, USA Detergents said.</p>
